// Read as TEXT by v2.lens.medium_structure_containment's host projection (parsed, never
// resolved into the live tree). The receipt scans THIS dir in isolation and asserts the guard
// detects EXACTLY the two planted leaks (the clean controls must NOT add to the count — the
